IP-CIDR,8.8.4.4/32,no-resolve
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,dnsleaktest.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,browserleaks.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,browserleaks.org
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ipleak.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ipleak.com
